{"overview":"دوئهٔ نهایی پلیس برای حفظ صلح اینجاست! افسر تازه‌کار نائو تازه به نیرو پیوسته؛ او مدال سیاه جودو دارد و به خاطر قدرت فوق‌العاده‌اش لقب «گوریلا» را گرفته. شریک او چوژو است که هر توانایی ذهنی‌ای را که می‌توان تصور کرد، در اختیار دارد. اما با این‌که می‌تواند ذهن دیگران را بخواند، هنوز نمی‌تواند فضا را درک کند. حالا این دو با هم در شینجوکو به مبارزه با جرم می‌پردازند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The ultimate police duo is here to keep the peace! Rookie officer Nao just joined the force. She’s got a black belt in judo and earned the nickname “Gorilla” for her insane strength. Then there’s her partner Chojo, who wields every psychic power imaginable. But for a guy who can read minds, he still can’t seem to read the room. Now, these two are taking on crime together in Chinjuku.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/nyKhYyqk9f5ttGV0qMTPYLeFkyP.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"小林裕介","role":"Meguru Chojo (voice)","photo":"/y4ukKDSobZJNuB4H3k89hkrKCDC.jpg","en":"Yusuke Kobayashi"},{"name":"碧乃梨心","role":"Nao Ippongi (voice)","photo":"/f8epNfLisB6cBDwfOaoMkj10RFP.jpg","en":"Riko Aono"},{"name":"ماریا ناگاناوا","role":"Robo-kun (voice)","photo":"/tt0j0z34Oq3MyvDA3VeizskWcw4.jpg","en":"Maria Naganawa"},{"name":"دایسوکه اونو","role":"Yuki Inukai (voice)","photo":"/5rjl28lx84JjRS0hzq3Ajvx2dhp.jpg","en":"Daisuke Ono"},{"name":"宮田俊哉","role":"Hajime Keinain (voice)","photo":"/6g0HUHtLaddU3q3hV4qF46bkzYB.jpg","en":"Toshiya Miyata"},{"name":"金光宣明","role":"Hossan (voice)","photo":"/wf7IW1avxFoY1zecsN5dvI1EdZX.jpg","en":"Nobuaki Kanemitsu"},{"name":"中村カンナ","role":"Lily Togari (voice)","photo":"/2HyCjHsT8hEpXsFe1CqtWJU6JNL.jpg","en":"Kanna Nakamura"},{"name":"浦和希","role":"Heisuke Ban (voice)","photo":"/7eUgENWREmWSMnLPUFCQhvUSpdI.jpg","en":"Kazuki Ura"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/327765/watch?locale=US","p":[{